{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123035","id":4402946358,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBm-hNg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123035","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123035.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123035.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123035","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123035/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123035/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123035/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/fe902d18b6ebbca21b869cd008e34e721cbcc5d1","number":123035,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix \"Cannot remove\" error when deleting files in the Web Editor","user":{"login":"shiva-kar","id":106133762,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlN5Ag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106133762?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar","html_url":"https://github.com/shiva-kar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n- Supersedes and closes #99769\r\n\r\n    - cc @khairul169\r\n\r\n- Closes #52239 \n- Closes #70975 \r\n\r\nFixes an issue where deleting a file in the Web Editor throws a \"Cannot remove\" error and fails to delete the file.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe delete dialog relies on `OS::move_to_trash()`, but this wasn't implemented for the web platform, causing it to always fail. \r\n\r\nSince the web doesn't have a system trash, this PR implements `OS_Web::move_to_trash()` to permanently delete the files instead (similar to how Android handles it). \r\n\r\nThis uses `DirAccess` for the deletion, which automatically triggers the IndexedDB sync so the file deletions are properly saved to the browser's persistent storage.\r\n\r\n## Before:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/37d45398-857c-4c80-a693-033f5fdb74f7\r\n\r\n## After:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5745c4c3-2f05-46c5-b958-a5550ecfb373\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,